{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/8458","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:09.596393+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"The code here (and above) should be using iree_vm_list_push_ref_move instead of retain, and all of the releases in the test file should be deleted: https://github.com/google/iree/blame/a0681259516418b0785e5fc9322e0f7f3856d4b7/iree/modules/check/check_test.cc#L187","created_at":"2022-03-04T02:52:52Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/8458#issuecomment-1058775539","id":1058775539,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/8458","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M4_G6Hz","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/1058775539/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-03-04T02:52:52Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/1058775539","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"While doing PR #8450 I noticed that in testcases where the same `buffer_view` appears multiple times in the inputs list passed to `iree_vm_invoke`, in order to not get a leak reported, I needed to correspondingly `release` it multiple times, like [here](https://sourcegraph.com/github.com/google/iree@a0681259516418b0785e5fc9322e0f7f3856d4b7/-/blob/iree/modules/check/check_test.cc?L288-297).\r\n\r\nThinking about it I realized that I don't understand `iree_vm_invoke`'s semantics. I also don't see it explained on its [comment](https://sourcegraph.com/github.com/google/iree@a0681259516418b0785e5fc9322e0f7f3856d4b7/-/blob/iree/vm/invocation.h?L24-37). Two things really that I dont understand:\r\n1. \"Ownership remains with the caller\" sounds to me like `iree_vm_invoke` should not leave upon return an increased refcount for the caller to decrement. \r\n2. If it's really the intended behavior that`iree_vm_invoke` leaves upon return an increased refcount on its inputs, then even then I don't understand why the amount by which the refcount is incremented should depend on how many times an input is repeated in the inputs list.\r\n\r\nEDIT: ooh is it due to asynchronous nature of `iree_vm_invoke` that it needs to increase refcounts?  but then it would still surely be able to later decrement refcounts when it's finished working, so even so I still dont understand why in this test I had to add the release calls.\r\n\r\n@benvanik @ScottTodd ?","closed_at":"2022-03-04T16:54:39Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id